  "sourceAssignment": "Completion 169 Stardrop exclusively owns all four chronological stardrop-part1 through part4 original families, including navigation, both failed approaches, five undos, one restart, the simultaneous ghost/falling-flag construction and the final 169 / ten-flower pause. All 20 original/sidecar files remain retained. No other level or hunt source is reassigned.",
